{"id":"327b5aca93ba8aef","group":"16","path":"16/16-lem-fibre-yoneda.md","title":"纤维 Yoneda","display":"lem-fibred-yoneda — 纤维 Yoneda","type":"lemma","metadata":{"type":"lemma","book":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory","book_abbrev":"16","chapter":"1","label":"16-lem-fibre-yoneda","aliases":["16-lem-fibre-yoneda","Fibred Yoneda lemma","16-lem--fibre-yoneda"],"display":"lem-fibred-yoneda — 纤维 Yoneda","depends_on":["[[16-df-slice-category]]","[[16-df-fibred-functor]]","[[16-df-cleavage]]","[[16-df-substitution-functor]]","[[16-df-natural-transformation-definition]]","[[16-df-functor]]","[[16-df-category]]"],"source":"Lemma 5.2.4(i) and proof, pp. 323–324 (PDF 343–344)","revision_date":"2026-10-20"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"lemma"},{"key":"book","html":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"16"},{"key":"chapter","html":"1"},{"key":"label","html":"16-lem-fibre-yoneda"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>16-lem-fibre-yoneda</span><span>Fibred Yoneda lemma</span><span>16-lem--fibre-yoneda</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"lem-fibred-yoneda — 纤维 Yoneda"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"0cd12b341f6289c0\" href=\"?note=0cd12b341f6289c0\" title=\"16-df-slice-category\">16-df-slice-category</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"afc1fb30a05f3662\" href=\"?note=afc1fb30a05f3662\" title=\"16-df-fibred-functor\">16-df-fibred-functor</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"4ea27d39c2af987b\" href=\"?note=4ea27d39c2af987b\" title=\"16-df-cleavage\">16-df-cleavage</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"f12a7a1ec4908770\" href=\"?note=f12a7a1ec4908770\" title=\"16-df-substitution-functor\">16-df-substitution-functor</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"25140205ca0312de\" href=\"?note=25140205ca0312de\" title=\"16-df-natural-transformation-definition\">16-df-natural-transformation-definition</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"fc49efccd7348d66\" href=\"?note=fc49efccd7348d66\" title=\"16-df-functor\">16-df-functor</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"25a281534aa42440\" href=\"?note=25a281534aa42440\" title=\"16-df-category\">16-df-category</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source","html":"Lemma 5.2.4(i) and proof, pp. 323–324 (PDF 343–344)"},{"key":"revision_date","html":"2026-10-20"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cloven}(p,\\kappa)\">\\(\\mathrm{Cloven}(p,\\kappa)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p:\\mathcal E\\to\\mathcal B\">\\(p:\\mathcal E\\to\\mathcal B\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal B\">\\(I\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal B\\)</span>；纤维与重索引采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"4ea27d39c2af987b\" href=\"?note=4ea27d39c2af987b\" title=\"16-df-cleavage\">16-df-cleavage</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"f12a7a1ec4908770\" href=\"?note=f12a7a1ec4908770\" title=\"16-df-substitution-functor\">16-df-substitution-functor</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{dom}_I:\\mathcal B/I\\to\\mathcal B\">\\(\\operatorname{dom}_I:\\mathcal B/I\\to\\mathcal B\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"0cd12b341f6289c0\" href=\"?note=0cd12b341f6289c0\" title=\"16-df-slice-category\">16-df-slice-category</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FibredFunctor}\">\\(\\mathrm{FibredFunctor}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{VerticalNat}\">\\(\\mathrm{VerticalNat}\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"afc1fb30a05f3662\" href=\"?note=afc1fb30a05f3662\" title=\"16-df-fibred-functor\">16-df-fibred-functor</a>。所有函子和变换的数据在足够大的宇宙中编码。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cat}\">\\(\\mathrm{Cat}\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"25a281534aa42440\" href=\"?note=25a281534aa42440\" title=\"16-df-category\">16-df-category</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Fun}\">\\(\\operatorname{Fun}\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-13\" data-note=\"25140205ca0312de\" href=\"?note=25140205ca0312de\" title=\"16-df-natural-transformation-definition\">16-df-natural-transformation-definition</a> 的函子记录集合。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{NatIso}\">\\(\\mathrm{NatIso}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Functor}\">\\(\\mathrm{Functor}\\)</span> 分别采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-14\" data-note=\"25140205ca0312de\" href=\"?note=25140205ca0312de\" title=\"16-df-natural-transformation-definition\">16-df-natural-transformation-definition</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-15\" data-note=\"fc49efccd7348d66\" href=\"?note=fc49efccd7348d66\" title=\"16-df-functor\">16-df-functor</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf{CartFun}_{\\mathcal B}(\\operatorname{dom}_I,p)\">\\(\\mathbf{CartFun}_{\\mathcal B}(\\operatorname{dom}_I,p)\\)</span> 与评价函子 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V_I\">\\(V_I\\)</span> 在下文构造。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\nO&amp;\\coloneqq\\{H\\in\\operatorname{Fun}(\\mathcal B/I,\\mathcal E)\n\\mid\\mathrm{FibredFunctor}(H;\\operatorname{dom}_I,p)\\},\\\\\nM&amp;\\coloneqq\\{\\langle H,K,\\alpha\\rangle\\mid H,K\\in O\n\\land\\alpha\\in\\prod_{a\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal B/I)}\\mathcal E(Ha,Ka)\n\\land\\mathrm{VerticalNat}(\\alpha:H\\Rightarrow K)\\},\\\\\ns\\langle H,K,\\alpha\\rangle&amp;\\coloneqq H,\n\\qquad t\\langle H,K,\\alpha\\rangle\\coloneqq K,\\\\\ne(H)&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle H,H,(\\operatorname{id}_{H(a)})_{a\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal B/I)}\\rangle,\\\\\nc(\\langle K,L,\\beta\\rangle,\\langle H,K,\\alpha\\rangle)\n&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle H,L,(\\beta_a\\alpha_a)_{a\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal B/I)}\\rangle,\\\\\n\\mathcal H_I&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle O,M,s,t,e,c\\rangle,\n\\qquad\\mathbf{CartFun}_{\\mathcal B}(\\operatorname{dom}_I,p)\\coloneqq\\mathcal H_I,\\\\\n(V_I)_0(H)&amp;\\coloneqq H(\\operatorname{id}_I),\n\\qquad(V_I)_1\\langle H,K,\\alpha\\rangle\\coloneqq\\alpha_{\\operatorname{id}_I},\\\\\nV_I&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle(V_I)_0,(V_I)_1\\rangle,\\\\\n\\mathrm{Cat}(\\mathcal H_I)&amp;,\\qquad\\mathrm{Functor}(V_I,\\mathcal H_I,\\mathcal E_I).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\nO&amp;\\coloneqq\\{H\\in\\operatorname{Fun}(\\mathcal B/I,\\mathcal E)\n\\mid\\mathrm{FibredFunctor}(H;\\operatorname{dom}_I,p)\\},\\\\\nM&amp;\\coloneqq\\{\\langle H,K,\\alpha\\rangle\\mid H,K\\in O\n\\land\\alpha\\in\\prod_{a\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal B/I)}\\mathcal E(Ha,Ka)\n\\land\\mathrm{VerticalNat}(\\alpha:H\\Rightarrow K)\\},\\\\\ns\\langle H,K,\\alpha\\rangle&amp;\\coloneqq H,\n\\qquad t\\langle H,K,\\alpha\\rangle\\coloneqq K,\\\\\ne(H)&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle H,H,(\\operatorname{id}_{H(a)})_{a\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal B/I)}\\rangle,\\\\\nc(\\langle K,L,\\beta\\rangle,\\langle H,K,\\alpha\\rangle)\n&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle H,L,(\\beta_a\\alpha_a)_{a\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal B/I)}\\rangle,\\\\\n\\mathcal H_I&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle O,M,s,t,e,c\\rangle,\n\\qquad\\mathbf{CartFun}_{\\mathcal B}(\\operatorname{dom}_I,p)\\coloneqq\\mathcal H_I,\\\\\n(V_I)_0(H)&amp;\\coloneqq H(\\operatorname{id}_I),\n\\qquad(V_I)_1\\langle H,K,\\alpha\\rangle\\coloneqq\\alpha_{\\operatorname{id}_I},\\\\\nV_I&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle(V_I)_0,(V_I)_1\\rangle,\\\\\n\\mathrm{Cat}(\\mathcal H_I)&amp;,\\qquad\\mathrm{Functor}(V_I,\\mathcal H_I,\\mathcal E_I).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\bigl(\\exists Q\\in\\operatorname{Fun}(\\mathcal E_I,\\mathcal H_I)\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\left(\\exists\\eta\\in\\prod_{X\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal E_I}\\mathcal E_I(X,V_IQX)\\right)\n\\left(\\exists\\epsilon\\in\\prod_{H\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal H_I}\\mathcal H_I(QV_IH,H)\\right)\\\\\n&amp;\\bigl[\\mathrm{NatIso}_{\\mathcal E_I,\\mathcal E_I}(\\eta:\\operatorname{Id}_{\\mathcal E_I}\\Rightarrow V_IQ)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{NatIso}_{\\mathcal H_I,\\mathcal H_I}(\\epsilon:QV_I\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{Id}_{\\mathcal H_I})\\bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\bigl(\\exists Q\\in\\operatorname{Fun}(\\mathcal E_I,\\mathcal H_I)\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\left(\\exists\\eta\\in\\prod_{X\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal E_I}\\mathcal E_I(X,V_IQX)\\right)\n\\left(\\exists\\epsilon\\in\\prod_{H\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal H_I}\\mathcal H_I(QV_IH,H)\\right)\\\\\n&amp;\\bigl[\\mathrm{NatIso}_{\\mathcal E_I,\\mathcal E_I}(\\eta:\\operatorname{Id}_{\\mathcal E_I}\\Rightarrow V_IQ)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{NatIso}_{\\mathcal H_I,\\mathcal H_I}(\\epsilon:QV_I\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{Id}_{\\mathcal H_I})\\bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>垂直自然变换的单位与逐分量复合仍自然、垂直，故 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal H_I\">\\(\\mathcal H_I\\)</span> 是完整范畴；评价保留单位与复合。</li>\n<li>给 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\in\\mathcal E_I\">\\(X\\in\\mathcal E_I\\)</span> 定义 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H_X(u:J\\to I)=u^*X\">\\(H_X(u:J\\to I)=u^*X\\)</span>。对切片箭头 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a:u\\to v\">\\(a:u\\to v\\)</span>，以 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa(v,X)H_X(a)=\\kappa(u,X)\">\\(\\kappa(v,X)H_X(a)=\\kappa(u,X)\\)</span> 唯一确定其像。唯一性给出函子律和笛卡尔保持；对垂直 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f:X\\to Y\">\\(f:X\\to Y\\)</span> 用分量 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u^*f\">\\(u^*f\\)</span> 得到函子 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q\">\\(Q\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa(\\operatorname{id}_I,X)\">\\(\\kappa(\\operatorname{id}_I,X)\\)</span> 是垂直同构，给出 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\cong V_IQX\">\\(X\\cong V_IQX\\)</span>；对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H\">\\(H\\)</span>，保持 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u\\to\\operatorname{id}_I\">\\(u\\to\\operatorname{id}_I\\)</span> 的笛卡尔提升给出 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u^*H(\\operatorname{id}_I)\\cong H(u)\">\\(u^*H(\\operatorname{id}_I)\\cong H(u)\\)</span>。笛卡尔唯一性给出其对切片箭头以及对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H\">\\(H\\)</span> 的自然性，故得到所列两个自然同构。</li>\n<li>来源：Jacobs, Lemma 5.2.4(i) and proof, pp. 323–324（PDF 343–344）。本页只陈述一般 cleavage 的等价；原书的 split 版本还需限制适当的严格保持函子，未由此无条件升级为同构。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"16-df-slice-category","status":"resolved","id":"0cd12b341f6289c0","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-slice-category]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-fibred-functor","status":"resolved","id":"afc1fb30a05f3662","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-fibred-functor]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-cleavage","status":"resolved","id":"4ea27d39c2af987b","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-cleavage]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-substitution-functor","status":"resolved","id":"f12a7a1ec4908770","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-substitution-functor]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-natural-trans